Syntax: pray 'clot' <target>

The Clot prayer halts bleeding from open wounds by accelerating the body's
natural clotting process. The divine magic forces blood to coagulate
rapidly, sealing wounds that might otherwise prove fatal from blood loss.

While the prayer effectively stops bleeding, it does not sterilize the
wound or promote proper healing. Debris and contaminants may become sealed
within the injury, potentially leading to infection. For this reason, clot
is often followed by sterilize and proper healing prayers when time permits.

In emergency situations, clot can save lives by preventing death from
blood loss. The prayer works on any bleeding wound regardless of cause,
making it invaluable in combat where serious injuries are common.

See Also: STERILIZE, SALVE, CURE DISEASE
